# Pairs with TypeOK. The full capture records a frontier beyond the WAL's
# heads, outside the declared domain of a recorded frontier.
MODULE: TypeOkFullHeadsPastLog
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the full capture records a frontier past the heads
PERTURBS: FullHeads

--- FIND
    /\ pending' = Lens
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: a frontier past the heads.
    /\ pending' = [p \in Parts |-> Len(wal[p]) + 5]
--- END
